# Cistern Hall's overflow channel with the suit on (CIPlay cistern_hall_acidsuit, 11-11; in a test world 'CI ...', under
# CIGapsWatchHealth, no CIGapsSuit): the suit from the box on the bank west of the mouth (53 -62.5), down to the mouth at
# the waterline (62 -64.3), then the acid takes nothing (expect unhurt) all the way to the overflow locker and back.
# cistern_hall_acid is the run without the suit and the valve.
island Cistern Hall keep
offset 0 0
hour 11
weather Calm
at 55 -62
use chflowsuits
expect shown chflowacid
at 62 -64.6
walk 62 -64.6 to 62 -61 to 62 -57 to 62.3 -52.4
wait 6
expect unhurt
open Overflow locker
wait 2
walk 62.3 -52.4 to 62 -57 to 62 -61 to 62 -64.6
expect unhurt
